    },
    "1. Open the Health app and tap your profile picture." : {

    },
    "2. Under Privacy, tap Apps or Apps and Services, then Cecy." : {

    },
    "3. Turn on Menstruation (Menstrual Flow) under the data Cecy is allowed to read." : {

    },
    "4. Return to Cecy and tap Check again (or Review Apple Health samples)." : {

    },
